Package: chromosomix
Type: Package
Title: The 'chromosomix' Hi-C Viewer as an HTML Widget
Version: 0.16.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jacques", "Serizay", email = "jacquesserizay@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The 'chromosomix' viewer (<https://chromosomix.app/>) - a contact
    map with its tracks, a 1D genome browser or a 3D model of a genome - in an
    R Markdown document, a Quarto page, the RStudio viewer or a Shiny app. It
    is the viewer's own embed in an <iframe>, driven from R through its
    message channel; files on this machine are served to it by byte range from
    a server on the loopback interface, and nothing is uploaded.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://chromosomix.app/, https://github.com/js2264/chromosomix
BugReports: https://github.com/js2264/chromosomix/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    htmlwidgets (>= 1.5),
    httpuv (>= 1.6),
    jsonlite,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    callr,
    knitr,
    openssl,
    rmarkdown,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny (>= 1.6),
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
